<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET - TRANSVAAL, WESTERN PROVINCE DRAW.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - TRANSVAAL, WESTERN PROVINCE DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Supersport series cricket match finishing on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In Johannesburg: Transvaal 371 and 263-8 declared. Western Province 227 and 352-7 (Herschelle Gibbs 103, H.D. Ackerman 122 Eric Simons 58 not out). Match drawn.</p>
</text>
